  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-31T07:05:27.762Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The projector component would be nice to quickly project a texture on your avatar's mesh without having to do any kind of complicated modifications in blender. After playing around with it a bit (and placing over 100 of them with the same material on a model in unity) I determined they aren't that large of a hit to performance and could probably be included with 'Particles and Lights' in safety.\nI personally would use them to project a logo/insignia/etc onto the side of a model, use them for a damage effect on the surface of a metal plate, bullet holes, and so on.",
